hadiths[50]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2007","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri achhi sohbat ka sab se zyada haqdaar kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhaari maan. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Phir tumhaari maan. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Phir tumhaari maan. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Phir tumhaara baap. (Bukhari: 5971)"
"2008","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak badey kabeeron mein se hai ke aadmi apne maan baap ko gaali dey. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Aur aadmi apne maan baap ko kaisey gaali deta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi aadmi key baap ko gaali deta hai aur wo uskey baap ko gaali deta hai aur uski maan ko gaali deta hai. (Bukhari: 5973)"
"2009","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Qata karney wala Jannat mein daakhil na hoga. (Bukhari: 5984)"
"2010","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak rishtedaari Rehman mein se shaakh hai. To Allah ne farmaya: Jo tumhey jodey main use jodunga. Aur jo tumhey kaatay main use kaatunga. (Bukhari: 5988)"
"2011","[AI-translation] Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khullam khulla baghair raaz key farmatey huey suna: Beshak fulaan key baap key ghar waley merey dost nahi hain. Beshak mera dost Allah aur nek momin hain. Lekin unkey liye rishtedaari hai jise main uski tari se geela rakkhunga. (Bukhari: 5990)"
"2012","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Milaanay wala badla denay wala nahi hai. Lekin milaanay wala wo hai jab uski rishtedaari kaati jaey to use jodey. (Bukhari: 5991)"
"2013","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Dehaati Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Tum bachchon ko choomtey ho? To ham unhey nahi choomtey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhaarey liye maalik hun ke Allah ne tumhaarey dil se rehmat kheenchi hai. (Bukhari: 5998)"
"2014","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas qaidi aey. Phir qaidiyon mein se aurat thi jiska doodh behta tha. Wo pilaati thi. Jab wo qaidiyon mein bachcha paati to use leti aur apne pet se lagati aur use doodh pilaati. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: Kya tum dekhtey ho ke ye apne bachchey ko aag mein phenkney wali hai? Ham ne kaha: Nahi, jabke wo taaqat rakhti hai ke use na phenkey. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah apne bandon par is se zyada rehem karney wala hai jitna ye apne bachchey par hai. (Bukhari: 5999)"
"2015","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah ne rehmat ko sau hisson mein banaaya. To apne paas ninyanbe hissay rakkhey aur zameen mein aik hissa utaara. To us hissey se makhlooq rehem karti hai yahan tak ke ghodi apna khur apne bachchey se uthaati hai is khauf se ke use lagey. (Bukhari: 6000)"
"2016","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey pakadtey aur mujhey apni raan par bithaatey aur Hasan ko apni doosri raan par bithaatey. Phir un donon ko milaatay, phir farmaatey: Ae Allah! Un donon par rehem farma! (Bukhari: 6003)"
"2017","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz mein khadey huey aur ham Aap key sath khadey huey. To dehaati ne namaz mein kaha: Ae Allah! Mujh par aur Muhammad par rehem farma! Aur hamarey sath kisi par rehem na farma! Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salaam kya to dehaati se farmaya: Beshak tum ne kushaada ko tang kar diya hai. (Bukhari: 6010)"
"2018","[AI-translation] Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mominon ko unki meherbaani aur unki mohabbat aur unki hamdardi mein jism jaisa dekhtey ho. Jab aza zakhmi hota hai to uska baaqi jism jaagney aur bukhaar key sath uskey liye pukaarta hai. (Bukhari: 6011)"
"2019","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman jo darkht lagaata hai aur us mein se insaan ya jaanwar khaata hai magar wo uskey liye sadqa hota hai. (Bukhari: 6012)"
"2020","[AI-translation] Jareer bin Abdullah se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo rehem nahi karta us par rehem nahi kya jaata. (Bukhari: 6013)"
"2021","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jibreel mujhey padosi ki wasiyat kartey rahey yahan tak ke main ne gumaan kya ke wo use waaris banaayega. (Bukhari: 6014)"
"2022","[AI-translation] Abu Shuraih (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam wo imaan nahi rakhta! Allah ki qasam wo imaan nahi rakhta! Allah ki qasam wo imaan nahi rakhta! Kaha gaya: Aur kaun Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Wo jiska padosi uski buraai se aman mein na ho. (Bukhari: 6016)"
"2023","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo apne padosi ko takleef na dey. Aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo apne mehmaan ki izzat karey. Aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo bhalai kahey ya khaamosh rahey. (Bukhari: 6018)"
"2024","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har neki sadqa hai. (Bukhari: 6021)"
"2025","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah har muamley mein narmi ko pasand karta hai. (Bukhari: 6024)"
"2026","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Momin momin key liye imaarat jaisa hai jo baaz baaz ko mazboot karta hai. Phir Aap ne apni ungliyon mein tashbeek ki. (Bukhari: 6026)"
"2027","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gaali deney waley aur na fahhash aur na laanat karney waley they. Aap ham mein se kisi se malaamat key waqt farmaatey: Use kya hua ke uski peshaani khaak aalood ho! (Bukhari: 6031). Anas se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein sab se haseen aur sab se sakhi aur sab se bahaadur they. Aur Madina waley aik raat darey aur log aawaaz ki taraf chaley. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka isteqbaal kya jabke Aap logon se pehley aawaaz ki taraf sabqat ley gaey they jabke Aap farma rahey they: Tum daraaye na jaaoge, tum daraaye na jaaoge! Jabke Aap Abu Talha key nange ghodey par they jis par zeen na thi. Aapki gardan mein talwaar thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main ne use samandar paaya hai, ya beshak wo samandar hai. (6033). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2028","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kisi cheez key baarey mein kabhi nahi poochha gaya aur Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. (Bukhari: 6034)"
"2029","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki das saal khidmat ki. To Aap ne mujh se uff nahi kaha aur na tum ne kyun kya aur na tum ne kyun nahi kya. (Bukhari: 6038)"
"2030","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Aadmi aadmi par fisq se tohmat nahi lagaata aur na us par kufr se tohmat lagaata hai magar wo us par wapas aati hai agar uska saathi waisa na ho. (Bukhari: 6045)"
"2031","[AI-translation] Darkht walon mein Saabit bin Zahhaak (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Islam key siwa millat par qasam khaey to wo jaisa us ne kaha. Aur Aadam key betey par nazr nahi hai jismein wo maalik nahi hai. Aur jo apne aap ko duniya mein cheez se qatl karey to use Qiyaamat key din uskey sath azaab diya jaaeyga. Aur jo momin par laanat karey to wo uskey qatl jaisa hai. Aur jo momin par kufr se tohmat lagaaey to wo uskey qatl jaisa hai. (Bukhari: 6047). Aisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Aap ko khabar di, unhon-ne kaha: Aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangi. To Aap ne farmaya: Use ijazat do! Qabeelay ka bura bhai, ya qabeelay ka beta! Phir jab wo daakhil hua to Aap ne uskey liye baat naram ki. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum ne jo kaha kaha. Phir tum ne uskey liye baat naram ki? Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Beshak logon mein burey hain jinhey log chhorte hain, ya log rukhsat detey hain, uski fahhashi se bachney key liye. (6054). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."

"2032","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Chugli khor Jannat mein daakhil na hoga. (Bukhari: 6056)"
"2033","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum Qiyaamat key din Allah key paas logon mein burey paaogey do chehron waley ko jo inkey paas chehrey sey aata hai aur unkey paas chehrey sey. (Bukhari: 6058)"
"2034","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bugz na karo aur hasad na karo aur peeth na moro! Aur Allah key bandon bhai bhai ho jao! Aur Musalman key liye halaal nahi hai ke wo apne bhai se teen din se zyada qata karey. (Bukhari: 6065)"
"2035","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gumaan se bacho! Beshak gumaan sab se jhooti baat hai. Aur taak jhaank na karo aur jasusi na karo aur dhoka na do aur hasad na karo aur bugz na karo aur peeth na moro! Aur Allah key bandon bhai bhai ho jao! (Bukhari: 6066)"
"2036","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main gumaan nahi karta ke fulaan aur fulaan hamaarey deen mein se kuchh jaantey hain. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Hamaarey deen ko jaantey hain jis par ham hain. (Bukhari: 6068)"
"2037","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Meri ummat mein har ek aafiyat wala hai magar khullam khulla karney waley. Aur beshak khullam khulla mein se hai ke aadmi raat ko amal karey, phir subah karey jabke Allah ne use us par dhaanpa hai. To wo kahey: Ae fulaan! Main ne kal raat aisa aisa kya. Jabke wo raat guzaarta hai jabke uska Rab use dhaanpta hai. Aur wo subah Allah key parday ko us se kholta hai. (Bukhari: 6069)"
"2038","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi key liye halaal nahi hai ke wo apne bhai se teen raaton se zyada qata karey. Wo donon miltey hain aur ye munh morta hai aur ye munh morta hai. Aur un donon mein behtar wo hai jo salaam mein pehal karta hai. (Bukhari: 6077)"
"2039","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak sach neki ki raah dikhaata hai. Aur beshak neki Jannat ki raah dikhaati hai. Aur beshak aadmi sach bolta hai yahan tak ke wo siddique ho jaata hai. Aur beshak jhoot fahhashi ki raah dikhaata hai. Aur beshak fahhashi aag ki raah dikhaati hai. Aur beshak aadmi jhoot bolta hai yahan tak ke wo Allah key paas kazzaab likha jaata hai. (Bukhari: 6094)"
"2040","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Koi ya koi cheez Allah se zyada takleef par sabr karney wali nahi hai jo us ne suni hai. Beshak wo uskey liye beta pukaartey hain jabke wo unhey aafiyat deta hai aur unhey rizq deta hai. (Bukhari: 6099)"
"2041","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taqatwar kushti larnay wala nahi hai. Beshak taqatwar wo hai jo ghussay key waqt apne aap par qaabu rakkhey. (Bukhari: 6114)"
"2042","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Mujhey wasiyat kijiye! Aap ne farmaya: Ghussa na karo! To us ne baar baar dohraaya. Aap ne farmaya: Ghussa na karo! (Bukhari: 6116)"
"2043","[AI-translation] Imraan bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sharm sirf bhalai ley kar aati hai. (Bukhari: 6117)"
"2044","[AI-translation] Abu Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jo logon ne pehli nabuwwat ki baat mein paaya: Jab tum sharm na karo to jo chaaaho karo. (Bukhari: 6120)"
"2045","[AI-translation] Maalik key betey Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham se miltey they yahan tak ke merey chhotay bhai se kehtey: Ae Abu Umair! Nughair ne kya kya? (Bukhari: 6129)"
"2046","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Momin aik suraakh se do martaba nahi dasa jaata. (Bukhari: 6133)"
"2047","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak shair mein hikmat hai. (Bukhari: 6145)"
"2048","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ka pet peep se bhar jaey wo uskey liye behtar hai is se ke wo shair se bharey. (Bukhari: 6154)"
"2049","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai ke dehaat walon mein se aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Qiyaamat kab khadi hogi? Aap ne farmaya: Tum par afsos! Aur tum ne uskey liye kya tayyaar kya hai? Us ne kaha: Main ne uskey liye tayyaar nahi kya magar ye ke main Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum uskey sath ho jis se tum ne mohabbat rakhi. To ham ne kaha: Aur ham aise hi? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. (Bukhari: 6167). Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya: Aadmi qaum se mohabbat rakhta hai jabke wo un se nahi mila? Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi uskey sath hai jis se us ne mohabbat rakhi. Abu Muawiya aur Muhammad bin Ubaid ne mutabaat ki. (6168). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2050","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak dhoka denay waley key liye Qiyaamat key din jhanda uthaya jaaeyga. Kaha jaaeyga: Ye fulaan bin fulaan ki dhoka hai. (Bukhari: 6177)"
"2051","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur wo kehtey hain angoor? Beshak angoor momin ka dil hai. (Bukhari: 6183). Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Ham mein se aadmi key haan ladka paida hua aur us ne uska naam Qaasim rakkha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham tumhey Abul Qaasim kunniyat na dengey aur tumhaari aankh na thandi karengey. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko uska zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne betey ka naam Abdur Rahman rakkho! (6189). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Musayyib se uskey waalid se riwayat hai ke uska waalid Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhaara naam kya hai? Us ne kaha: Hazn. Aap ne farmaya: Tum Sahl ho! Us ne kaha: Main naam na badlunga jo merey waalid ne mujhey diya hai. Musayyib ne kaha: Hamaarey darmiyaan uskey baad sakhti rahi. (6190). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Sahl se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Usaid key betey Munzir ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas laaya gaya jab wo paida hua tha. To Aap ne use apni raan par rakkha jabke Abu Usaid baithey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne saamney cheez se kheley. To Abu Usaid ne apne betey ka hukm diya aur wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan se utha liya gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaagey aur farmaya: Bachcha kahaan hai? To Abu Usaid ne kaha: Ham ne use palat diya Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Uska naam kya hai? Us ne kaha: Fulaan. Aap ne farmaya: Lekin uska naam Munzir rakkho! To us din uska naam Munzir rakkha. (6191). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2052","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Zainab (Raziallahu anha) ka naam Barra tha. To kaha gaya: Wo apne aap ko paak karti hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska naam Zainab rakkha. (Bukhari: 6192)"
"2053","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umm Sulaim (Raziallahu anha) bojh mein theen. Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ghulaam Anjasha unhey haankta tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Anjasha! Aahista, sheeshiyon ko haankna! (Bukhari: 6202)"
"2054","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qiyaamat key din Allah key paas ganday naamon mein aadmi hai jo Baadshahon ka Baadshah kehlata hai. (Bukhari: 6205)"
"2055","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas do aadmiyon ne chheenka. To Aap ne un mein se aik ko chheenk ka jawaab diya aur doosrey ko chheenk ka jawaab na diya. To Aap se kaha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye Allah ki hamd karta hai. Aur ye Allah ki hamd nahi karta. (Bukhari: 6221)"
"2056","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah chheenk ko pasand karta hai aur jamaahi ko naapasand karta hai. Phir jab wo chheenkey aur Allah ki hamd karey to har Musalman par haq hai jo use suney ke use chheenk ka jawaab dey. Aur jamaahi to shaitaan se hai, use jitna ho sakey wapas karey. Phir jab wo haa kahey to us se shaitaan hansta hai. (Bukhari: 6223). Abu Hurairah se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne Aadam ko apni soorat par paida kya. (6227). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Istezaan ki kitaab."
